{"seq":2,"slug":"swi-prolog-ecosystem","title":"SWI-Prolog 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/swi-prolog-ecosystem","wordCount":1211,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"swi-prolog-生态\">SWI-Prolog 生态</h1><p>SWI-Prolog 是当前使用最广泛、生态最完整的 Prolog 实现。自 1987 年由 Jan Wielemaker 在阿姆斯特丹大学创建以来，它从学术工具演化为工业级平台——支持多线程 HTTP 服务器、Python/C/Java 互操作、WebAssembly 编译、完整的 RDF/SPARQL 语义网栈、以及活跃的包管理生态。截至 2025 年，稳定版为 9.2.x 系列，开发版已进入 10.1.x。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 之所以成为事实标准，取决于几个相互支撑的能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>WAM 上的工程化扩展</strong>：多线程、增量 GC、JIT 索引与 tabling 都在经典引擎之上做了实用化改造；</li>\n<li><strong>互操作性</strong>：Janus（Python）、C 与 Java 外接口，让 Prolog 推理与外部生态结合；</li>\n<li><strong>Web 与语义网栈</strong>：内置 HTTP 服务器与 <code>library(semweb)</code>，使 Prolog 可直接作为服务端与知识库；</li>\n<li><strong>包管理</strong>：<code>pack_install</code> 从 Git 仓库直接安装扩展，生态可自我扩展；</li>\n<li><strong>可移植性与部署</strong>：WebAssembly 编译使其能运行在浏览器与沙箱环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>关键库/机制</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td><code>library(thread)</code></td>\n<td>并行求解、服务端并发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互操作</td>\n<td><code>library(janus)</code></td>\n<td>结合 Python ML 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web 服务</td>\n<td><code>library(http/*)</code></td>\n<td>REST API、SWISH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义网</td>\n<td><code>library(semweb/*)</code></td>\n<td>RDF 存储与 SPARQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试与诊断</td>\n<td><code>library(plunit)</code>, <code>time/1</code></td>\n<td>质量保证与性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"架构与核心特性\">架构与核心特性</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 基于 Warren Abstract Machine（WAM）实现，但做了大量扩展以支持现代应用需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多线程</td>\n<td>POSIX 线程，每线程独立引擎</td>\n<td>共享代码区 + 独立栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垃圾回收</td>\n<td>增量式标记-压缩</td>\n<td>自动，无停顿感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 索引</td>\n<td>运行时按查询模式建立</td>\n<td>深度索引 + 多参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tabling</td>\n<td>修改版 SLG</td>\n<td>增量 + WFS + 线程安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块系统</td>\n<td>谓词可见性</td>\n<td>与 SICStus/YAP 兼容层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束</td>\n<td>属性变量框架</td>\n<td>CLP(FD), CLP(B), CHR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 查看系统信息&#10;?- current_prolog_flag(version, V).&#10;V = 90209.  % 9.2.9&#10;&#10;?- current_prolog_flag(bounded, false).  % 支持任意精度整数&#10;true.&#10;&#10;?- current_prolog_flag(threads, true).   % 多线程支持&#10;true.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 查看系统信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- current_prolog_flag(version, V).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>V = 90209.  % 9.2.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- current_prolog_flag(bounded, false).  % 支持任意精度整数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- current_prolog_flag(threads, true).   % 多线程支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"janus-python-互操作\">Janus：Python 互操作</h2><p>Janus 是 SWI-Prolog 9.1+ 引入的双向 Python-Prolog 接口——在同一进程内直接调用，零序列化开销。这使得 Prolog 的符号推理能力与 Python 的 ML/数据科学生态无缝结合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% Prolog 调用 Python&#10;:- use_module(library(janus)).&#10;&#10;%% 调用 Python 函数&#10;?- py_call(math:sqrt(16), Result).&#10;Result = 4.0.&#10;&#10;%% 使用 pandas 处理数据&#10;analyze_data(File, Stats) :-&#10;    py_call(pandas:read_csv(File), DF),&#10;    py_call(DF:describe(), Stats).&#10;&#10;%% 调用 ML 模型进行预测&#10;predict(Features, Label) :-&#10;    py_call(model:predict([Features]), [Label]).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% Prolog 调用 Python</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(janus)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 调用 Python 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- py_call(math:sqrt(16), Result).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Result = 4.0.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 使用 pandas 处理数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>analyze_data(File, Stats) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    py_call(pandas:read_csv(File), DF),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    py_call(DF:describe(), Stats).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 调用 ML 模型进行预测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>predict(Features, Label) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    py_call(model:predict([Features]), [Label]).</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python 调用 Prolog&#10;from janus_swi import *&#10;&#10;# 查询 Prolog&#10;prolog = janus_swi&#10;result = prolog.query_once(&quot;parent(tom, X)&quot;)&#10;# result = {&#39;X&#39;: &#39;bob&#39;}&#10;&#10;# 查询所有解&#10;results = list(prolog.query(&quot;ancestor(tom, X)&quot;))&#10;# [{&#39;X&#39;: &#39;bob&#39;}, {&#39;X&#39;: &#39;ann&#39;}, {&#39;X&#39;: &#39;pat&#39;}]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python 调用 Prolog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> janus_swi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询 Prolog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prolog </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> janus_swi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prolog.query_once(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"parent(tom, X)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># result = {'X': 'bob'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查询所有解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prolog.query(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ancestor(tom, X)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [{'X': 'bob'}, {'X': 'ann'}, {'X': 'pat'}]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>数据转换</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prolog → Python</td>\n<td><code>py_call/2,3</code></td>\n<td>自动：atom↔str, number↔number, list↔list</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python → Prolog</td>\n<td><code>janus_swi.query()</code></td>\n<td>自动：dict↔bindings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享对象</td>\n<td><code>py_object/1</code></td>\n<td>引用传递，避免复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"web-开发框架\">Web 开发框架</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 内置完整的 HTTP 服务器和客户端库，支持构建 RESTful API 和 Web 应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(http/thread_httpd)).&#10;:- use_module(library(http/http_dispatch)).&#10;:- use_module(library(http/http_json)).&#10;&#10;:- http_handler(&#39;/api/query&#39;, handle_query, [method(post)]).&#10;&#10;server(Port) :- http_server(http_dispatch, [port(Port)]).&#10;&#10;handle_query(Request) :-&#10;    http_read_json_dict(Request, Dict),&#10;    atom_string(Goal, Dict.query),&#10;    term_to_atom(Term, Goal),&#10;    ( call(Term) -&gt;&#10;        reply_json_dict(_{status: &quot;success&quot;, result: true})&#10;    ;&#10;        reply_json_dict(_{status: &quot;success&quot;, result: false})&#10;    ).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(http/thread_httpd)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(http/http_dispatch)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(http/http_json)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- http_handler('/api/query', handle_query, [method(post)]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server(Port) :- http_server(http_dispatch, [port(Port)]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>handle_query(Request) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    http_read_json_dict(Request, Dict),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    atom_string(Goal, Dict.query),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    term_to_atom(Term, Goal),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ( call(Term) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reply_json_dict(_{status: \"success\", result: true})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reply_json_dict(_{status: \"success\", result: false})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ).</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;HTTP 客户端&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;REST API&quot;| B[&quot;http_dispatch&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;路由匹配&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;处理器谓词&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Prolog 推理引擎&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;JSON 响应&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;需要 ML&quot;| G[&quot;Janus → Python&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[\"HTTP 客户端\"] --&gt;|\"REST API\"| B[\"http_dispatch\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"路由匹配\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"处理器谓词\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Prolog 推理引擎\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"JSON 响应\"]\n    F --&gt; A\n    D --&gt;|\"需要 ML\"| G[\"Janus → Python\"]\n    G --&gt; E</pre><h3 id=\"swish-基于-web-的-prolog-环境\">SWISH：基于 Web 的 Prolog 环境</h3><p>SWISH（SWI-Prolog for Sharing）是基于 SWI-Prolog HTTP 框架构建的在线 IDE，提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器内的 Prolog REPL</li>\n<li>代码笔记本（类似 Jupyter）</li>\n<li>协作编辑和分享</li>\n<li>内置可视化（表格、图表、渲染器）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"语义网与-rdf\">语义网与 RDF</h2><p><code>library(semweb)</code> 是 SWI-Prolog 最成熟的应用库之一，提供高性能 RDF 存储和 SPARQL 查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(semweb/rdf_db)).&#10;:- use_module(library(semweb/rdfs)).&#10;:- use_module(library(semweb/sparql_client)).&#10;&#10;%% 加载 RDF 数据&#10;?- rdf_load(&#39;ontology.owl&#39;).&#10;&#10;%% RDF 查询&#10;?- rdf(Subject, rdf:type, owl:&#39;Class&#39;).&#10;&#10;%% RDFS 推理（自动子类传递、域范围推导）&#10;?- rdfs_individual_of(X, animal).&#10;&#10;%% SPARQL 查询外部端点&#10;?- sparql_query(&#10;    &#39;SELECT ?name WHERE { ?p a foaf:Person; foaf:name ?name }&#39;,&#10;    Row,&#10;    [host(&#39;dbpedia.org&#39;), path(&#39;/sparql&#39;)]&#10;   ).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(semweb/rdf_db)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(semweb/rdfs)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(semweb/sparql_client)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 加载 RDF 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- rdf_load('ontology.owl').</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% RDF 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- rdf(Subject, rdf:type, owl:'Class').</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% RDFS 推理（自动子类传递、域范围推导）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- rdfs_individual_of(X, animal).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% SPARQL 查询外部端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- sparql_query(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'SELECT ?name WHERE { ?p a foaf:Person; foaf:name ?name }',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [host('dbpedia.org'), path('/sparql')]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   ).</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>规模支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rdf_db</code></td>\n<td>三元组存储</td>\n<td>数亿三元组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rdfs</code></td>\n<td>RDFS 推理</td>\n<td>自动传递闭包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sparql_client</code></td>\n<td>SPARQL 协议客户端</td>\n<td>联邦查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>turtle</code></td>\n<td>Turtle/N-Triples 解析</td>\n<td>流式加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rdf_portray</code></td>\n<td>RDF 可视化</td>\n<td>调试辅助</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"包管理与生态\">包管理与生态</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 的包管理器从 GitHub/GitLab 仓库直接安装扩展包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 安装包&#10;?- pack_install(mavis).       % 类型检查库&#10;?- pack_install(prosqlite).   % SQLite 接口&#10;?- pack_install(by_search).   % 全文搜索&#10;&#10;%% 列出已安装包&#10;?- pack_list_installed.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 安装包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- pack_install(mavis).       % 类型检查库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- pack_install(prosqlite).   % SQLite 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- pack_install(by_search).   % 全文搜索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 列出已安装包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- pack_list_installed.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键生态包：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包名</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>领域</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pengines</code></td>\n<td>远程 Prolog 引擎</td>\n<td>Web/分布式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prosqlite</code></td>\n<td>SQLite 数据库接口</td>\n<td>数据持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>real</code></td>\n<td>R 语言接口</td>\n<td>统计计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pldoc</code></td>\n<td>文档生成</td>\n<td>开发工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>plunit</code></td>\n<td>单元测试框架</td>\n<td>质量保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cplint</code></td>\n<td>概率逻辑编程</td>\n<td>AI/ML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aleph</code></td>\n<td>归纳逻辑编程</td>\n<td>机器学习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"开发工具链\">开发工具链</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 单元测试&#10;:- use_module(library(plunit)).&#10;&#10;:- begin_tests(lists).&#10;test(append) :-&#10;    append([1,2], [3,4], [1,2,3,4]).&#10;test(member, [nondet]) :-&#10;    member(_, [a,b,c]).&#10;test(length) :-&#10;    length([a,b,c], 3).&#10;:- end_tests(lists).&#10;&#10;?- run_tests.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 单元测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(plunit)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- begin_tests(lists).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test(append) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append([1,2], [3,4], [1,2,3,4]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test(member, [nondet]) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    member(_, [a,b,c]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test(length) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    length([a,b,c], 3).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- end_tests(lists).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- run_tests.</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 调试与性能分析&#10;?- gtrace.                    % 图形调试器&#10;?- profile(my_goal).          % CPU 性能分析&#10;?- time(expensive_query(X)).  % 计时和推理步数&#10;%% 输出: 1,234 inferences, 0.002 CPU in 0.002 seconds\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 调试与性能分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- gtrace.                    % 图形调试器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- profile(my_goal).          % CPU 性能分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- time(expensive_query(X)).  % 计时和推理步数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 输出: 1,234 inferences, 0.002 CPU in 0.002 seconds</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"webassembly-编译\">WebAssembly 编译</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 支持编译到 WebAssembly，使 Prolog 程序可以在浏览器中运行。SWISH 的在线 REPL 就基于此技术：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 在浏览器中使用 SWI-Prolog WASM&#10;import { SWIPL } from &#39;swipl-wasm&#39;;&#10;&#10;const swipl = await SWIPL();&#10;await swipl.call(&#39;assert(parent(tom, bob))&#39;);&#10;const result = await swipl.call(&#39;parent(tom, X)&#39;);&#10;// result.X = &#39;bob&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在浏览器中使用 SWI-Prolog WASM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { SWIPL } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'swipl-wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> swipl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SWIPL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> swipl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assert(parent(tom, bob))'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> swipl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'parent(tom, X)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// result.X = 'bob'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与其他系统的兼容性\">与其他系统的兼容性</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 提供了与 YAP、SICStus、XSB 和 IF/Prolog 的兼容层，便于移植代码。但各系统在 tabling、约束和模块系统上仍有差异——选择<a href=\"modern-logic-programming\">现代逻辑编程语言</a>时需要权衡这些差异对具体应用的影响。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>SWI-Prolog</th>\n<th>SICStus</th>\n<th>YAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>MIT</td>\n<td>商业</td>\n<td>LGPL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>最快之一</td>\n<td>很快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库生态</td>\n<td>最丰富</td>\n<td>精选</td>\n<td>适中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行业采用</td>\n<td>最广</td>\n<td>嵌入式/安全</td>\n<td>学术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护活跃度</td>\n<td>非常活跃</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>维护模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>SWI-Prolog 是入门与生产部署的首选实现，本文要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 WAM 但做了多线程、增量 GC、JIT 索引与 tabling 等大量工程化扩展；</li>\n<li>Janus 提供同进程的双向 Python 互操作，使 Prolog 推理能与 ML/数据科学生态直接结合；</li>\n<li>内置 HTTP 服务器与 <code>http_dispatch</code> 让 Prolog 可直接构建 REST API，SWISH 即是其应用之一；</li>\n<li><code>library(semweb)</code> 提供可支撑数亿三元组的 RDF 存储、RDFS 推理与 SPARQL 客户端；</li>\n<li><code>pack_install</code> 从 Git 仓库安装扩展，<code>pengines</code>、<code>prosqlite</code>、<code>cplint</code> 等覆盖分布式、持久化与概率编程；</li>\n<li><code>plunit</code> 与 <code>gtrace</code>/<code>profile</code>/<code>time</code> 覆盖测试、调试与性能分析；</li>\n<li>WebAssembly 编译让 Prolog 能运行在浏览器中；与 YAP/SICStus/XSB 有兼容层但语义仍有差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要评估这些差异对选型的影响，见<a href=\"modern-logic-programming\">现代逻辑编程语言</a>；若要了解它承载的典型推理任务，见<a href=\"knowledge-representation-ai\">知识表示与 AI 应用</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SWI-Prolog 生态","id":"swi-prolog-生态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构与核心特性","id":"架构与核心特性"},{"level":2,"text":"Janus：Python 互操作","id":"janus-python-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Web 开发框架","id":"web-开发框架"},{"level":3,"text":"SWISH：基于 Web 的 Prolog 环境","id":"swish-基于-web-的-prolog-环境"},{"level":2,"text":"语义网与 RDF","id":"语义网与-rdf"},{"level":2,"text":"包管理与生态","id":"包管理与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"开发工具链","id":"开发工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"WebAssembly 编译","id":"webassembly-编译"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他系统的兼容性","id":"与其他系统的兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"知识表示与 AI 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/knowledge-representation-ai"},"next":{"title":"现代逻辑编程语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/modern-logic-programming"}}